":"tiṇ","gloss":"strong/tight"}],"gloss":"tight"},{"surface":"பிணி","parts":[{"text":"பிணி","lemma":"piṇi","gloss":"binding/bound"}],"gloss":"bound"},{"surface":"முரசம்","parts":[{"text":"முரசம்","lemma":"muracam","gloss":"war drum"}],"gloss":"war drum"},{"surface":"இடைப்புலத்து","parts":[{"text":"இடைப்புலத்து","lemma":"இடைப்புலத்து","gloss":"in the middle of the field"}],"gloss":"in the middle of the field","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"இரங்க","parts":[{"text":"இரங்கு","lemma":"iraṅku","gloss":"sound/roar"},{"text":"அ","lemma":"a","gloss":"infinitive suffix"}],"gloss":"to roar"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"ஆர்","parts":[{"text":"ஆர்","lemma":"ār","gloss":"rare/difficult"}],"gloss":"rare"},{"surface":"அமர்","parts":[{"text":"அமர்","lemma":"amar","gloss":"battle/combat"}],"gloss":"combat"},{"surface":"மயங்கிய","parts":[{"text":"மயங்கு","lemma":"mayaṅku","gloss":"be confused/chaotic"},{"text":"இ","lemma":"i","gloss":"past tense marker"},{"text":"ய்","lemma":"y","gloss":"glide"},{"text":"அ","lemma":"a","gloss":"relative participle suffix"}],"gloss":"chaotic"},{"surface":"ஞாட்பின்","parts":[{"text":"ஞாட்பு","lemma":"ñāṭpu","gloss":"battlefield"},{"text":"இன்","lemma":"iṉ","gloss":"locative/oblique suffix"}],"gloss":"in the battlefield"},{"surface":"தெறுவர","parts":[{"text":"தெறு","lemma":"teṟu","gloss":"cause distress/fear"},{"text":"வர","lemma":"vara","gloss":"to come"}],"gloss":"terrifyingly"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"நெடு","parts":[{"text":"நெடு","lemma":"neṭu","gloss":"long"}],"gloss":"long"},{"surface":"வேல்","parts":[{"text":"வேல்","lemma":"vēl","gloss":"spear"}],"gloss":"spear"},{"surface":"பாய்ந்த","parts":[{"text":"பாய்","lemma":"pāy","gloss":"spring/strike"},{"text":"ந்","lemma":"ntu","gloss":"past tense marker"},{"text":"த்","lemma":"t","gloss":"past tense marker"},{"text":"அ","lemma":"a","gloss":"relative participle suffix"}],"gloss":"pierced"},{"surface":"நாண்","parts":[{"text":"நாண்","lemma":"nāṇ","gloss":"shame/pride/honor"}],"gloss":"proud"},{"surface":"உடை","parts":[{"text":"உடை","lemma":"uṭai","gloss":"possessing"}],"gloss":"possessing"},{"surface":"நெஞ்சத்து","parts":[{"text":"நெஞ்சத்து","lemma":"நெஞ்சத்து","gloss":"of the heart"}],"gloss":"of the heart","split_unverified":true}]},{"words":[{"surface":"அருகுகை","parts":[{"text":"அருகு","lemma":"aruku","gloss":"approach/near"},{"text":"கை","lemma":"kai","gloss":"action/hand"}],"gloss":"approaching"},{"surface":"…","parts":[{"text":"…","lemma":"…","gloss":"…"}],"gloss":"…"},{"surface":"மன்ற","parts":[{"text":"மன்ற","lemma":"maṉṟa","gloss":"indeed/certainly"}],"gloss":"indeed"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"குருதி","parts":[{"text":"குருதி","lemma":"kuruti","gloss":"blood"}],"gloss":"blood"},{"surface":"அடு","parts":[{"text":"அடு","lemma":"aṭu","gloss":"with/associated"}],"gloss":"with"},{"surface":"துயல்வரும்","parts":[{"text":"துயல்","lemma":"tuyal","gloss":"sway/shake"},{"text":"வரும்","lemma":"varum","gloss":"coming"}],"gloss":"swaying"},{"surface":"மார்பின்","parts":[{"text":"மார்பு","lemma":"mārpu","gloss":"chest"},{"text":"இன்","lemma":"iṉ","gloss":"oblique/genitive suffix"}],"gloss":"of the chest"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"முயக்கு","parts":[{"text":"முயக்கு","lemma":"muyakku","gloss":"embrace"}],"gloss":"embrace"},{"surface":"இடை","parts":[{"text":"இடை","lemma":"iṭai","gloss":"space/interval"}],"gloss":"space"},{"surface":"ஈயாது","parts":[{"text":"ஈ","lemma":"ī","gloss":"give"},{"text":"ஆது","lemma":"ātu","gloss":"negative adverbial participle suffix"}],"gloss":"without giving"},{"surface":"மொய்த்தன","parts":[{"text":"மொய்","lemma":"moy","gloss":"swarm"},{"text":"த்","lemma":"t","gloss":"past tense marker"},{"text":"த்","lemma":"t","gloss":"past tense marker"},{"text":"அன","lemma":"aṉa","gloss":"neuter plural suffix"}],"gloss":"swarmed"},{"surface":"பருந்தே","parts":[{"text":"பருந்து","lemma":"paruntu","gloss":"vulture"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ē","gloss":"emphasis particle"}],"gloss":"the vultures"}]}],"literal":"To take the earth, scratched, sharp-tipped horns / of majestic, fine bulls, two together, clashing, / the skin of the winner, without scraping, covered / tight-bound drum, in the middle of the field, sounding, / in the battle where rare combat is confused, causing fear, / long spear pierced, having a proud heart, / coming close ... indeed, / with blood swaying chest, / not giving space for an embrace, swarmed the vultures.","translation":"Like two majestic, fine bulls clashing together with their sharp-tipped horns that scratch the earth, the tight-bound war drum, covered with the unscraped skin of the victorious beast, roars in the middle of the battlefield. In that terrifying battle of chaotic, fierce combat, a long spear pierced the chest of the proud warrior. As he lies there, indeed, vultures swarm over his blood-smeared chest, leaving no room even for an embrace.","modern":"மண்ணைத் தோண்டுவதற்காக வளைந்த கூர்மையான கொம்புகளையுடைய பெருமையுடைய இரண்டு நல்ல காளைகள் ஒன்றுடன் ஒன்று முட்டிப் போரிட்டு, அதில் வென்ற காளையின் தோலைச் சீவாமல் போர்த்திய, உறுதியாகக் கட்டப்பட்ட முரசம் போர்க்களத்தின் நடுவே முழங்குகிறது. அரிய போர் மயங்கி நடைபெறும் போர்க்களத்தில் அச்சம் தரும்படியாக, நெடிய வேல் பாய்ந்த மானம் உடைய நெஞ்சினையும், குருதியோடு அசையும் மார்பினையும் உடைய வீரனைத் தழுவுவதற்குக் கூட இடைவெளி தராமல் பருந்துகள் மொய்த்துக் கொண்டிருக்கின்றன.","explanation":"This poem belongs to the Tumpai tiṇai (battle) and the theme of Mūtiṉ mullai (the valor of an ancient martial family). The poet Kaḻāttalaiyār describes a fierce battlefield where a brave warrior has fallen, pierced by a long spear. The poem opens with a vivid comparison of the war drum, covered with the raw skin of a victorious bull, to two majestic bulls clashing in combat. The warrior's chest is covered in blood, and he lies dead on the field. The vultures swarm so thickly over his body that there is no space left even for his loved ones to embrace him in grief. This stark image highlights the tragic yet glorious nature of a hero's death in classical Tamil warfare.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"}}